-     detail
-         Error `↯/s.93.2`: _the ar archive could not be read or written because `reason`_. Its
-         `#reason` is an `Ar.Error.Reason`, each with its own number and message:
+     detail
+         Erreur `↯/s.93.2` : _the ar archive could not be read or written because `reason`_. Sa
+         `#reason` est une `Ar.Error.Reason`, chacune avec son propre numéro et son propre
